-learning","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Transfer learning involves taking a pre-trained neural network and adapting the neural network to a new, different data set.  Depending on both:      the size of the new data set, and     the similarity of the new data set to the original data set  the approach for using transfer learning will be different. There are four main cases:      new data set is small, new data is similar to original training data     new data set is small, new data is different from original training data     new data set is large, new data is similar to original training data     new data set is large, new data is different from original training data  Four Cases When Using Transfer Learning","topics":[],"score":220228,"global_rank":226808},{"name":"anguslin/NLP-Stock-Predictor","owner":"anguslin","html_url":"https://github.com/anguslin/NLP-Stock-Predictor","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":220212,"global_rank":226839},{"name":"walter-lead/noir2color","owner":"walter-lead","html_url":"https://github.com/walter-lead/noir2color","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Colorize black-and-white pictures using cGAN","topics":["generative-adversarial-network","machine-learning","python","tensorflow"],"score":220187,"global_rank":226875},{"name":"lukemshannonhill/pet_classifier","owner":"lukemshannonhill","html_url":"https://github.com/lukemshannonhill/pet_classifier","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":5,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"testing the pet classifier as a web application as discussed in fastai lessons","topics":[],"score":220187,"global_rank":226877},{"name":"archisgore/hello-shor","owner":"archisgore","html_url":"https://github.com/archisgore/hello-shor","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description